# Hackathon submission (work in progress)

This repository is a **micro1 Agentic Workflows Hackathon** submission in progress, not a finished production product.

## Skills (Cursor project skills)

Load from `.cursor/skills/` (each folder contains `SKILL.md`). **Start with** `micro1-hackathon-orchestrator`, then follow its gate table. Do not skip gates.

| Gate | Skill directory |
|---|---|
| 1 | `hackathon-problem-framing` |
| 2 / 4 | `hackathon-agent-engineering` |
| 3 / 5 | `hackathon-baseline-and-eval` |
| 4 (log live) | `hackathon-improvement-changelog` |
| 6 | `hackathon-judging-rubric` |
| 7 | `hackathon-ground-rules-compliance` |
| 8 | `hackathon-final-deliverables` |

## Do not confuse with product skills

- Repo-root `SKILL.md` and `skills/honest-agent-launch-readiness/` are **runtime guardrail / launch-readiness** instructions for agents *using* HonestAgent, not the hackathon judging workflow.
- Never fabricate eval numbers. Log changelog rows in the same turn as a design change.
- Consequential actions stay deterministic + human-checkpointed (Ground Rules 04/05).
